Cell["Is this a problem of how we compute the Liouville Operator?", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9802165396208687`*^9, 3.980216574990467*^9}, {
  3.980216607280796*^9, 3.980216612703453*^9}, {3.980219419994692*^9, 
